        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Selective coating, copper sheet, physical vapour deposition
Inventory for selective coatings of solar absorbers.;
Synonyms: TINOX; 
UUID: f11228ee-222b-3d16-80bb-f846572738e8
Gate to gate inventory for the process including infrastructure, excluding process specific emissions. Not including eventual pre-treatment of copper sheets by supplier, packages, wastes.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: TINOX (titanium-nitrite-oxide) PVD process.
Time period: Environmental report.
Production volume: Data for the only known company.
Sampling: Publication. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f11228ee-222b-3d16-80bb-f846572738e8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
